%N A401330 Expansion of e.g.f. (1 - x)^(exp(-x) - 1).
%F A401330 a(0) = 1; a(n) = Sum_{k=1..n} ((k-1)! - A002741(k)) * binomial(n-1,k-1) * a(n-k).
%F A401330 a(n) ~ n! / (Gamma(1-exp(-1)) * n^(exp(-1))). - _Vaclav Kotesovec_, Oct 21 2026
%o A401330 (PARI) my(N=30, x='x+O('x^N)); Vec(serlaplace((1-x)^(exp(-x)-1)))
